WEBVTT

00:06:58.956 --> 00:07:00.541
that I had already developed

00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:02.793
could make a difference here, too.

00:07:02.835 --> 00:07:07.298
I could start something that could help
generations of future young researchers

00:07:07.339 --> 00:07:08.924
break into academia.

00:07:09.675 --> 00:07:15.431
So in 2021, my best friend and I gathered
a founding team of 31 college students

00:07:15.473 --> 00:07:20.519
and started another virtual nonprofit
called the Pre-College Research Institute.

00:07:20.519 --> 00:07:24.648
Together, we've created
four 32-hour virtual research courses

00:07:24.648 --> 00:07:29.528
that have taught, trained and inspired
160 high school students of color

00:07:29.528 --> 00:07:31.614
from Klerksdorp, South Africa